cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use COLLATZ Interpretation in academic work, please cite this software."
title: "COLLATZ Interpretation"
abstract: >
  An independent research consumer of the agnostic SHAPES structural
  core, providing a structural seed interpretation over STR.
  The implemented seed is not the Collatz 3n+1 iteration and does
  not establish the Collatz conjecture.
type: software
authors:
